   "Per-jurisdiction legal-basis catalog cites REAL, web-search-verified official
    sources; the EU/Germany entry is honestly :qualitative, no fabricated day-count"
   "DatomicStore uses the current langchain-store.core convention (ADR-2607141600)
    instead of hand-rolling the EDN-blob codec"
   "Portable .cljc, zero JVM-only constructs in src; clj-kondo 0 errors (1
    pre-existing-pattern warning shared with construction.notify, not a regression)"]
  :negative
  ["Real Datomic/kotoba-server deployment is a follow-up (in-memory MemStore is the
